{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I currently can't promise that there'll be an English version (for the complete game).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, there's only an English demo which covers the beginning of the game and Moran's line. The translation is done by myself and  the translation is not beta-ed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add demo to your STEAM library and choose the &quot;VersionEnglish&quot; branch to download the English demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0   <br>How to download the English demo:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Visit the demo store page. You can search &quot;The Game of The Playful demo&quot; in Steam store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Add demo to your library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Right click on the demo game in your library, and click Properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Select the Betas tab, and select the branch you want to switch to. Select &quot;VersionEnglish&quot;&quot; to download the English demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Wait until auto-update finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Recommend you to check the integrity of game files if you have changed a branch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm having some difficulties in my job, so for some time I probably won't be able to update the English translation. But if you want to give me some advice on grammar mistakes in this game, it's welcomed and please send me an <a href=\"mailto:email(1263040030@qq.com)\">email(1263040030@qq.com)</a>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help translate this game, you can also email me. However, I'm pretty unwilling to spend more money on this game, so (although I might be willing to give you some kind of reward) the reward won't be much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, thank you very much for visiting this page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If after auto update, you find bugs, please check the integrity of game files</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game of The Playful is a visual novel created by one person (characters are drew by outsourced artists). The engine used by this game is Visual Novel Maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, you'll play as the Heroine and experience nine individual stories. In each story, you will establish either friendship or romantic relationships with a character. All nine stories are independent from each other, so you'll be dating with only one person in one story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1359440?t=1758467945","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758467945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758467945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758467945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains suggested themes. \r\nThe game does not have nude pictures. Suggested themes are discribed in an implicit way.\r\nAll characters in the game are over 18 years old."},"demos":[{"appid":1365790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I currently can't promise that there'll be an English version (for the complete game).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, there's only an English demo which covers the beginning of the game and Moran's line. The translation is done by myself and  the translation is not beta-ed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add demo to your STEAM library and choose the &quot;VersionEnglish&quot; branch to download the English demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0   <br>How to download the English demo:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Visit the demo store page. You can search &quot;The Game of The Playful demo&quot; in Steam store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Add demo to your library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Right click on the demo game in your library, and click Properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Select the Betas tab, and select the branch you want to switch to. Select &quot;VersionEnglish&quot;&quot; to download the English demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Wait until auto-update finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Recommend you to check the integrity of game files if you have changed a branch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm having some difficulties in my job, so for some time I probably won't be able to update the English translation. But if you want to give me some advice on grammar mistakes in this game, it's welcomed and please send me an <a href=\"mailto:email(1263040030@qq.com)\">email(1263040030@qq.com)</a>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to help translate this game, you can also email me. However, I'm pretty unwilling to spend more money on this game, so (although I might be willing to give you some kind of reward) the reward won't be much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, thank you very much for visiting this page!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If after auto update, you find bugs, please check the integrity of game files</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game of The Playful is a visual novel created by one person (characters are drew by outsourced artists). The engine used by this game is Visual Novel Maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this visual novel, you'll play as the Heroine and experience nine individual stories. In each story, you will establish either friendship or romantic relationships with a character. All nine stories are independent from each other, so you'll be dating with only one person in one story.</p>","developers":["\u6df1\u84dd\u5236\u4f5c\u7ec4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/header.jpg?t=1758467945","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175810,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175810/movie480.mp4?t=1753892202","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175810/movie_max.mp4?t=1753892202"},"name":"The Game of The Playful game video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175810/dfe93f1308c31d3ee26abf3c330a9baaf0978de7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753892202","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175810/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753892202","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175810/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753892202"}}],"name":"The Game of The Playful","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \u65e0\u7279\u6b8a\u8981\u6c42<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> We're very sorry, the English version is currently not available.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> please make the window at the front, otherwise the game load will be postponed</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10/11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7\u53ca\u4ee5\u4e0a<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \u65e0\u7279\u6b8a\u8981\u6c42<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> please make the window at the front, otherwise the game load will be postponed</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u6df1\u84dd\u5236\u4f5c\u7ec4"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating":"l"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"16 Jul, 2020"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/0514fefe09044c5ca626e0de1e9de11e88abf5c0/ss_0514fefe09044c5ca626e0de1e9de11e88abf5c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758467945","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/0514fefe09044c5ca626e0de1e9de11e88abf5c0/ss_0514fefe09044c5ca626e0de1e9de11e88abf5c0.600x338.jpg?t=1758467945"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/fa79540328942a09dc8f7fa18bea6e8c05fa47ad/ss_fa79540328942a09dc8f7fa18bea6e8c05fa47ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758467945","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359440/fa79540328942a09dc8f7fa18bea6e8c05fa47